            "code": "\n\tif value[\u0027assetId\u0027] is None or value[\u0027startDate\u0027] is None or value[\u0027endDate\u0027] is None: return system.dataset.toDataSet([], [])\n\n\treturn system.kanoa.operators.getOLEDataAssetByInterval(value[\u0027assetId\u0027], value[\u0027startDate\u0027], value[\u0027endDate\u0027], value[\u0027interval\u0027])\n\t",
